","content":"Who, me or The MG?<br /> <br /> I think I'll just drop the images back down to links. Let the hosts get their proper hits. (I keep forgetting why hotlinking is bad. I don't usually link a lot of images, and if I do, they usually are from Deviantart or similar sites.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T16:26:25-07:00","id":269590,"title":"","content":"Everyone puts waaaaay too much effort into thinking about it. The Bond is an inescapable relationship is all. The form it takes can vary between pairs and between incarnations. I've seen Lunar stalkers, sisters, smoking buddies, and mothers-in-law. Because it's so vague, you can apply it to any two paired protagonists, really.<br /> <br /> Hotlinking steals bandwidth without providing traffic. Even without loading the image, you are still hotlinking, which is why the image is still the drug logo.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm working on it, all right?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/130-gensh","name":"Gensh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar130_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"128"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T16:5